=================== LEAD 4, SETTLED: the boundary ===================
All cells: ONE flow, 0% loss on the wire (iperf3's own sender line), 1400 B frames,
3 sampling hops (s1,s5,s2 -- read from the row's own path), 1/256 Bernoulli sampling.
obs = fraction of 30 one-second polls in which that window said the flow was there.
pred = 1-exp(-lambda*W), lambda from the proxy's own send-side counter.

